{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"structural_monotony\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The essay does reuse a similar analytical arc in several middle paragraphs, but the annotator gave no textual support for a whole-document structural judgment.\",\"evidence\":[\"The earliest translations favoured the shorter lyrics.\",\"Language intensified the change.\",\"Reception then fed back into later translation.\"]},{\"id\":\"tonal_uniformity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"A steady academic-critical register does hold across the piece, but the annotator supplied no evidence for this whole-document claim.\",\"evidence\":[\"Readers in the receiving country encountered not simply a foreign writer but a figure assembled by translators, editors and critics for local purposes.\",\"Translators often regularised these features, partly to achieve fluency and partly because the receiving culture valued polish as evidence of poetic seriousness.\",\"To trace that making is to see translation not as a transparent vehicle between fixed works, but as one of the places where literary identity itself is produced.\"]},{\"id\":\"faux_specificity\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"The cited phrase is thematic summary, not fake concrete detail pretending to be lived specificity. It names recurrent motifs rather than performing spurious sensory exactness.\",\"evidence\":[\"images of night, solitude and ruined landscapes\"]},{\"id\":\"neutrality_collapse\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The document does take a position, but the annotator did not support that clear judgment with textual evidence.\",\"evidence\":[\"This transformation should not be dismissed as mere distortion.\",\"But that career belonged to a collaborative construction.\"]},{\"id\":\"even_jargon_distribution\",\"verdict\":\"misclassified\",\"rationale\":\"The clear/no-defect status is reasonable, but the selected answer is wrong. Technical vocabulary is distributed across the essay in a natural way rather than clumping in one specialist section.\",\"evidence\":[\"Translation selected from it, rearranged its emphases and supplied it with a new literary ancestry.\",\"Translators often regularised these features, partly to achieve fluency and partly because the receiving culture valued polish as evidence of poetic seriousness.\",\"Reception then fed back into later translation.\"]},{\"id\":\"forced_synesthesia\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"There does not appear to be any forced cross-sensory metaphor, but the annotator gave no supporting evidence for the clear judgment.\",\"evidence\":[\"their images of night, solitude and ruined landscapes suited contemporary tastes\",\"Rhyme was sometimes added where the original relied on rhythm and internal echo.\",\"its experiments influenced younger poets who could not read the original language\"]},{\"id\":\"generic_metaphors\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"These metaphors are conventional, but they do carry concrete argumentative meaning in context rather than substituting for it. The annotator overstates them as defective.\",\"evidence\":[\"When the poet’s work crossed the border, it did not arrive intact.\",\"translation not as a transparent vehicle between fixed works\"]},{\"id\":\"referential_clarity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The references are generally recoverable, but the annotator offered no evidence for the clear judgment.\",\"evidence\":[\"These versions were elegant, but their elegance altered the poet’s voice.\",\"Translators chose poems that confirmed it.\",\"But that career belonged to a collaborative construction.\"]},{\"id\":\"formulaic_parallelism\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"The bicolon is compressed, but it states a specific semantic shift already prepared by the preceding sentences; it is not empty symmetry