 landscapes suited contemporary tastes.\",\"Translators often regularised these features, partly to achieve fluency and partly because the receiving culture valued polish as evidence of poetic seriousness.\",\"But that career belonged to a collaborative construction.\"]},{\"id\":\"genre_specific\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The piece reads as academic/critical prose, and the cited sentence makes an evidentiary claim about critics and tradition without naming a source or case. That is a valid genre-specific weakness.\",\"evidence\":[\"Critics compared the poet with a celebrated national tradition, emphasising spiritual inwardness and treating historical references as universal symbols.\"]}]}"}}
